Create a sci-fi movie poster showing an abandoned space station floating above a dark alien planet. Use sharp geometric lines from the station and curved organic lines from the planet to guide the viewer toward a lone astronaut. Use large circular and rectangular shapes with plenty of negative space to create a lonely mood. Give the station a smooth metallic texture and the planet a rough, rocky texture, with the objects appearing massive and three-dimensional. Use strong contrast between bright white light and deep blue-black shadows to make the astronaut the main focal point.
Lines: The curved, actual and implied lines in space guide the viewer's attention towards the astronaut in the space station poster.
Shape : The geometrical shapes, especially the circular shape of the station structure and the small shape of the astraounaut gives viewvers to create a strong focal point.
Texture: The space station has a rough, worn metal texture, and the ground where the astronaut is standing gives a rough, rocky texture to the viewers.
Volume: The space station has three- dimensional volume because of the shadows. Especially the curved surface lighting appears as a large sphere. The astronaut's volume through shadows highlights his spacesuit, and the figure looks solid instead of flat.  
Contrast: The bright light of the moon against the dark space and shadows makes the astronaut and space station more noticeable and creates a mysterious mood.
